  "label": "The young man is mapped as the 'holocaust' in the meme",
  "description": "The bottom text 'holocaust' is juxtaposed with the visual of the young man, creating an analogical mapping where the young man is being equated with or represents the Holocaust. This is a deeply offensive and harmful mapping that trivializes the Holocaust by associating it with a mundane, personal scenario involving the young man. The mapping is established through the visual-textual juxtaposition, where the text 'holocaust' is placed directly below the image of the young man, forcing the viewer to associate the visual entity with the textual entity in a shocking and inappropriate way.",
